{
  "mn72:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 72 ",
  "mn72:0.2": "Aggivacchasutta ",
  "mn72:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn72:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn72:2.1": "Atha kho vacchagotto paribbājako yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "mn72:2.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn72:3.1": "“Kiṁ nu kho, bho gotama, ‘sassato loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’ti—",
  "mn72:3.2": "evaṁdiṭṭhi bhavaṁ gotamo”ti? ",
  "mn72:3.3": "“Na kho ahaṁ, vaccha, evaṁdiṭṭhi: ",
  "mn72:3.4": "‘sassato loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’”ti. ",
  "mn72:4.1": "“Kiṁ pana, bho gotama, ‘asassato loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’ti—",
  "mn72:4.2": "evaṁdiṭṭhi bhavaṁ gotamo”ti? ",
  "mn72:4.3": "“Na kho ahaṁ, vaccha, evaṁdiṭṭhi: ",
  "mn72:4.4": "‘asassato loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’”ti. ",
  "mn72:5.1": "“Kiṁ nu kho, bho gotama, ‘antavā loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’ti—",
  "mn72:5.2": "evaṁdiṭṭhi bhavaṁ gotamo”ti? ",
  "mn72:5.3": "“Na kho ahaṁ, vaccha, evaṁdiṭṭhi: ",
  "mn72:5.4": "‘antavā loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’”ti. ",
  "mn72:6.1": "“Kiṁ pana, bho gotama, ‘anantavā loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan’ti—",
  "mn72:6.2": "evaṁdiṭ�